62
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,240
Xingcan.

63
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,800
I'm coming to save you.

64
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:39,840
Chenyao, are you okay?

65
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:46,480
Chenyao.

66
