96
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,560
Meeting you in this life

97
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,640
has been, in my short life,

98
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:47,900
the happiest

99
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,700
