Don't.

121
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:12,480
Don't.

122
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:15,840
Don't.

123
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,780
Please, don't.

124
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,120
Xingcan.

125
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:26,420
Xingcan.

126
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:29,240
You can stand on your own now.

127
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,800
You don't need me anymore.

128
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,480
No, I don't want to.

129
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:39,560
