130
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:42,740
There must be another way.

131
00:09:42,940 --> 00:09:44,480
There must be.

132
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:47,530
Chenyao.

133
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:50,660
Xingcan.

134
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:53,980
I always thought

135
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,300
I stayed by your side

136
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:57,900
to atone for my sins.

137
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,800
Only now do I realize

138
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:05,840
I... I did all this

139
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,240
because

140
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:10,380
I

141
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,360
love

142
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,760
you.

143
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:36,660
Chenyao.

144
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,040
Chenyao.

145
00:10:49,140 --> 00:10:49,940
Chenyao.

146
00:10:51,340 --> 00:10:51,440
Three, Huoyu.

147
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,200
Chenyao.

148
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:55,200
Chenyao.

149
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:08,640
Chenyao.

150
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,440
Chenyao.

151
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,800
Yao.

152
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:29,720
Chenyao.

153
00:11:30,860 --> 00:11:31,660
Chenyao.

154
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:36,240
Chenyao.

155
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:42,840
Chenyao.

156
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,480
Miss Gu, after you were thrown into the lake,

157
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,580
