178
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,940
That person just left.

179
00:12:57,980 --> 00:13:00,180
This is the phone number he left for you.

180
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,480
Already paid?

181
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,700
Thank you.

182
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,030
You're welcome.

183
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:29,560
Hello.

184
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:31,440
This is...

185
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:42,840
Hello,

186
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,320
Chenyao.

187
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,780
I've already arrived.

188
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,600
Sorry, wrong person.

189
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:49,740
Psycho.

190
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:51,860
Everything

191
00:13:52,980 --> 00:13:54,540
