194
00:14:14,340 --> 00:14:15,940
After leaving the hospital,

195
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:18,440
I resumed my investigation into Lingze.

196
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:22,180
Having lost the protection of the person in my dreams,

197
00:14:22,180 --> 00:14:24,240
I can only face all challenges alone.

198
00:14:25,940 --> 00:14:27,280
Even though difficulties

199
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:29,480
weigh on me like mountains.

200
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:32,440
Whenever I feel inadequate

201
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,540
and think of giving up,

202
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,700
I always remember the words of that person in my dreams.

203
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:40,480
I made up my mind

204
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:44,640
to become someone who can handle difficulties independently.

205
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:45,970
This is also the promise

206
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:47,800
I made to that person.

207
00:14:52,540 --> 00:14:53,740
To gather evidence,

208
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:56,240
I decided to put aside our past differences

209
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:58,040
and work with Mucheng again.

210
00:14:58,980 --> 00:14:59,640
This time,

211
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,940
I acted as Mucheng's attorney.

212
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:04,980
Following the clues between Hao Zhenshi and Mucheng,

213
00:15:04,980 --> 00:15:05,980
I dug deeper.

214
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,400
In the end,

215
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:08,870
with Xiaoya's help,

216
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:11,380
we successfully persuaded Li Qianqian.

217
00:15:11,580 --> 00:15:13,910
With the sisters' seamless cooperation,

218
00:15:13,980 --> 00:15:16,340
we finally gathered all the evidence.

219
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:25,400
We officially filed a lawsuit against Ling Ze and Ling Hengsheng.

220
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,260
Faced with conclusive evidence,

221
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:30,640
Ling Hengsheng and his son could no longer escape the law.

222
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:40,140
The court pronounces the following judgment:

223
00:15:40,140 --> 00:15:42,600
The plaintiff's claims are established

224
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:43,880
and supported.

225
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:47,340
The defendant's related defenses are dismissed.

226
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:49,580
In the end,

227
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,740
we used legal means

228
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:54,410
and successfully sent them to prison.

229
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,660
A year's time

230
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,600
passed by

231
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:18,640
in a flash.

232
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:20,380
Now,

233
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,400
I have grown into

234
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:23,980
a mature

235
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,040
and experienced lawyer.

236
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,880
I also founded my own law firm.

237
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:32,800
I finally fulfilled my promise to that person.

238
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,580
This way,

239
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:36,940
my father in heaven

240
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,080
can rest in peace.

241
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,080
This

242
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,340
is the complete story

243
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,180
of my dream.

244
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:04,079
What caught your eye?

245
00:17:07,359 --> 00:17:08,380
Little girl,

246
00:17:08,780 --> 00:17:10,260
you have good taste.

247
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:14,280
A good friend of mine gave this to me.

248
00:17:14,599 --> 00:17:16,400
He said to leave it with me

249
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,200
for someone destined to have it.

250
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:20,400
Where is this friend of yours?

251
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:21,560
Him?

252
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:24,420
Who knows where he went to enjoy himself.

253
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:31,880
Someone you can never forget,

254
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:34,580
is it possible to actually meet them?

255
00:17:34,580 --> 00:17:35,520
Time,

256
00:17:35,940 --> 00:17:37,300
is like a galaxy,

257
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:39,560
gathered by light-years.

258
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:42,740
But occasionally,

259
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:45,480
you can see it when you look up.

260
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:51,540
How about this?

261
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,840
I'll give it to you

262
00:17:54,380 --> 00:17:57,400
as a memento of our meeting.

263
00:17:57,540 --> 00:17:58,180
Is that okay?

264
00:17:58,180 --> 00:17:59,040
Of course.

265
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,080
Take it.

266
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:01,400
Thank you.

267
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:01,880
I'll take it then.

268
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:02,540
No problem.

269
00:18:49,580 --> 00:18:50,380
Dad,

270
00:18:52,380 --> 00:18:53,400
don't worry.

271
00:18:56,940 --> 00:18:58,560
I can stand on my own now.
